flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md 4.4, 10.1-10.2, H-07, MVP.

    start([Start: individual wants to preserve prompt work])
    entry{First use or returning?}
    onboarding[Onboarding]
    portfolio[Personal Portfolio]
    empty[Empty Portfolio]
    add["[TBD Screen] Add Prompt"]
    detail[Prompt Detail]
    search[Search and Filters]
    found{Saved prompt found?}
    no_results[Unverified / TBD: No Results]
    reused[Prompt Reused]
    end_saved([End: prompt saved with history])
    end_reused([End: saved prompt reused])

    start --> entry
    entry -->|First use| onboarding
    onboarding -->|Add your first prompt| add
    entry -->|Returning| portfolio
    portfolio -->|No saved prompts| empty
    empty -->|Add prompt| add
    portfolio -->|Add prompt| add
    add -->|Save| detail
    add -->|Cancel| portfolio
    detail -->|Prompt preserved| end_saved
    portfolio -->|Find prompt| search
    search -->|Search or filter| found
    found -->|Yes| detail
    found -->|No| no_results
    no_results -->|Refine search| search
    no_results -->|Add prompt| add
    detail -->|Reuse| reused
    reused --> end_reused
